    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33650" root="فرغ" body-key="f">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْرَغُ</span></b>  [<i>More,</i> and <i>most, empty</i> &amp;c.: and <i>more,</i>
and <i>most, free</i> from business &amp;c.]. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَفْرَغُ مِنْ فُؤَادِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُمِّ مُوسَى</span> [<i>More void than the heart,</i> or <i>mind, of
the mother of Moses</i>] is a prov. (Meyd. [See
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَارِغٌ</span>, latter half.]) See also another prov., voce
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَجَّامٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَارِغٌ</span>, q. v.: (O, K:) fem.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرْغَآءُ</span>: see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فَرِيغٌ</span>.

